  - m_Id: 1166523652628480
    m_Localized: 'Developed by RubyKnight


      icons from icons8.com

      SFX
      from www.zapsplat.com


      contact

      rubyknightsgame@gmail.com'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1176110300651520
    m_Localized: 'You can change the camera perspective by pressing W, A, S, D, or
      Esc.



      You can roll the dice by dragging and releasing the dice.



      Clicking
      on a slot allows you to enter the face of the current dice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1178274037227520
    m_Localized: Usually, people memorize it to two decimal places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1180119744897024
    m_Localized: 'Have you exited the maze?



      Do you remember the process?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1180968550391808
    m_Localized: Please give this stage a name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1181435435147264
    m_Localized: "You didn't really read that \nas \"7\", did you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1182632439177216
    m_Localized: "\u25A0=4"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1183095519698944
    m_Localized: There's one thing you missed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1358665654198272
    m_Localized: Primary colors of light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1452557628071936
    m_Localized: "I am your friend dances with you \nbut the one who cannot sing.\r\n\r\nI
      am a companion always with you \nbut the one who disappears at night.\r\n\r\nWho
      am I from another dimension?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2176594784280576
    m_Localized: "twinkle twinkle\u266A"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2195468720267264
    m_Localized: "Don't miss even \nthe little things.\r\n\r\nYou can only click
      on \ndice and slots.\r\n\r\nHints can be viewed\nby pressing the ? button."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2195616531734528
    m_Localized: Hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2195828868374528
    m_Localized: Credit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205371623006208
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations!

      You win!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205858753667072
    m_Localized: "This is a secret, \nwe are preparing \na hidden stage!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2206131035299840
    m_Localized: Hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2208898307055616
